      "text": "# dsh-remote-access bundle patch.\n#\n# The plugin starts a password-protected remote gateway in front of the local\n# DSH web server. It does not change the DSH server's own loopback binding.\n#\n# Configure the \"远程\" settings tab after the plugin loads, or override this\n# config in a profile patch layer; an empty password leaves the gateway stopped.\n- insert:\n    - id: dsh-remote-access\n      name: dsh-remote-access\n      config:\n        enabled: true\n        remoteHost: '0.0.0.0'\n        remotePort: 3081\n        password: ''\n        enableCaptcha: false\n        maxAttemptsPerDay: 20\n        maxAttemptsPer5h: 10\n        sessionTtlMs: 604800000\n        maxSessions: 100\n"
